{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oceanic Rails is an island builder focused on managing your crops and animals while creating cool synergies and seeing your island grow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/207dee5818d173ee0abc8e3c1c5e5bed.poster.avif?t=1756274122\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/207dee5818d173ee0abc8e3c1c5e5bed.apng?t=1756274122\" class=\"bb_img\" width=462 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit helpers to build your island full of vegetation, animals, decorations and a train? Manage your island well, upgrading plants, optimizing for space and betting on the sell prices of your harvests.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 3 different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Island:</strong> No pressure, no stress. Enjoy the company of your helpers and build the island you want. They don't like water, so make sure to pick them up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Trip</strong>: Limited time, limited resources. Manage and improve your crops, helpers and buildings; every trip is different, with different days that can cause mayhem in your island. But local merchants might be able to help you with  many modifiers to add to your map, your plants, and your helpers. Make sure to pay your rent at the end of the week!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenge:</strong>\u00a0Short, sweet, challenging and very fun. Explore different challenges that test your skills. Only one crop, islands spread around, and constant extreme weather are just some of the things that await you in the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/c37c606cb35d432df8182594c66ee256.poster.avif?t=1756274122\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/c37c606cb35d432df8182594c66ee256.webm?t=1756274122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/c37c606cb35d432df8182594c66ee256.mp4?t=1756274122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3132700?t=1756274122","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756274122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/d916d71c315ce45424717a498125d34dd4250f0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756274122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/d916d71c315ce45424717a498125d34dd4250f0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756274122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oceanic Rails is an island builder focused on managing your crops and animals while creating cool synergies and seeing your island grow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/207dee5818d173ee0abc8e3c1c5e5bed.poster.avif?t=1756274122\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: re